      "text": "✅ Power Platform integration\n✅ Power Automate workflows\n✅ Teams、Microsoft 365 Copilot\nintegration\n✅ SharePoint, Teams, Dataverse\nknowledge sources\n✅ 1000+ Connector\n\nTypical examples:\n- HR FAQ Agent \n- IT Helpdesk Agent \n- Employee Onboarding Agent  \n- Internal Knowledge Assistant \n",
